    "created_at": "2023-09-29T06:30:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-29T06:30:17Z",
    "body": "Yes, we strip a set of headers related to the request body. But not all headers. That's very much intentional as the request body isn't forwarded either in these cases (all of these go to `GET` which doesn't have a body).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
