    "updated_at": "2023-09-29T16:05:00Z",
    "body": "Thanks!  It was acknowledged as an implementation bug, so no issue with the spec.\r\n\r\nStill curious about the POST special case for 301 and 302s;  is that just for legacy reasons?",
