    "created_at": "2023-09-29T16:14:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-29T16:14:25Z",
    "body": "Browsers convert POST to GET for those and have done so forever, yes. It's allowed by the HTTP RFC and it's why we have 307 and 308 now (they don't do that).",
